mrman is a Go reimplementation of tuicr (https://github.com/agavra/tuicr).
Substantial portions of its structure are ported from that project: the review
model, keybindings, comment scopes, slug-addressed session storage, the
persisted session JSON format, and much of the test suite used as the
behavioral specification. tuicr is distributed under the MIT License, whose
copyright and permission notice is reproduced in full below.

